# The module socket (manifest + island cards) and the filament presets are data
# the wheel must carry, so `pip install git+... && a3d register` works on a
# machine that has never seen the module. Kept in step with setup.py's
# package_data. Verified by building the wheel and listing it.
recursive-include aethelark3d/module *
recursive-include aethelark3d/filaments/presets *.json
